分に復讐するかのように今を楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の娘としての容姿を巧みに使って人生を楽に渡っていくのが目的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは同じ茶道部に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目に部活などする気はなく、いつも不真面目な態度を主人公に叱られているがまったく気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※注　女装非処女です！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4315","sourceWorkId":"20555","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩のビッチキャラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子っぽいと苛められて不遇の幼少期をおくるが、自分にある天性の男ころがしの才能に気づき、ある日覚醒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去の惨めな自分に復讐するかのように今を楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の娘としての容姿を巧みに使って人生を楽に渡っていくのが目的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは同じ茶道部に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目に部活などする気はなく、いつも不真面目な態度を主人公に叱られているがまったく気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※注　女装非処女です。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55385"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26316","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4315","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4315","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55385","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/baeba156745ad005f55b37e8d21d4e4534fc6a56b0a2ebcceedabac83b4b5732.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50c5df602d9881f6bf27edc11357e721e1a92c86d1e15dc0b3c89208e221cdba.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天乙准花","creatorId":"vndb:s339","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s339","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s339","name":"椎那 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:107645:55385:7890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26313","characterName":"谷嶋 健人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26313"},"originalCharacterName":"谷嶋 健人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"sou